          "settings": {
            "title": "<strong>Features & Materials</strong>",
            "content": "<ul><li><strong>Taille                                             </strong>Petite</li><li><strong>Adaptabilité                          </strong>Convient aux hauts de bébés, enfants et femmes. Idéal pour les leggings, collants, boxers pour hommes et vêtements de taille jeunesse.</li><li><strong>Capacité     </strong>Peut contenir 6 à 10 petits classeurs à vêtements dans une boîte Pliio.</li><li><strong>Dimensions (Impérial) </strong>5\" W x 10.75\" L x 0.25\" D</li><li><strong>Dimensions (Métrique)</strong>13 cm W x 27 cm L x 0.6 cm D</li><li><strong>Poids</strong>1,5 onces (44 g) chacun</li></ul><p><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Set of 7 Small Filers</strong> (foldable clothes organizers) designed for leggings, tights, men’s boxers, and youth-sized clothing.</li><li><strong>Durable Construction:</strong> Crafted from smooth, high-quality material that prevents fabric snags for long-lasting use.</li><li><strong>Portable & Convenient:</strong> Ideal for home organization and travel. Fits neatly in most standard dresser drawers and can also be placed on a shelf or in a closet.</li><li><strong>Wrinkle-Free Organization:</strong> The sturdy structure keeps soft clothing upright, wrinkle-free, and easy to access, making it easier to store and maintain.</li><li><strong>Eco-Friendly:</strong> Made from high-quality recycled materials, ensuring sustainability and environmental friendliness.</li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> PLIIO Clothing Filers fit in drawers. They can also be lined up on bookshelves maximizing space in narrow areas.</li><li><strong>Easy Maintenance:</strong> Simply wipe down with cold water and a soft sponge for cleaning.<br/><br/></li></ul>",
